/// Rate-limit retry semantics for the dio GitHub client (gh-351).
///
/// Dart port of the Java `RetryPolicy.calculateDelayMs` rate-limit branches
/// (Java fix fab5b0ea, "honor GitHub X-RateLimit-Reset wait instead of
